        "text": "Judge Daniel Edward Maloney was appointed to the Cook County Circuit Court in 2019 and elected in 2020. He hears traffic and misdemeanor cases in Markham. He also presides over drug, mental health, and veterans treatment courts. From 2001 to 2019, he was a Cook County assistant state's attorney, prosecuting narcotics and murder cases. He serves on the Special Supreme Court Advisory Committee for Justice and Mental Health Planning.",
